Package: vivobook-fan-control-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: WILBOARDS <WILBOARDS@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@, pkexec
Recommends: systemd
Breaks: vivobook-fan-control (<< 1.2.0)
Replaces: vivobook-fan-control (<< 1.2.0)
Description: Control ASUS Vivobook fans from the command line
 Reads the asus hwmon device exposed by the Vivobook 14X M7400QE / M7400QC and
 switches each fan between firmware automatic control and full speed.
 .
 This package links against Qt Core only, so it pulls no GUI stack onto a
 headless or minimal system. It carries the polkit-authorized root helper, the
 temperature policy daemon and both system units. Install
 vivobook-fan-control as well for the graphical window.

Package: vivobook-fan-control
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: WILBOARDS <WILBOARDS@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@, vivobook-fan-control-cli (= @VERSION@)
Description: Graphical fan control for ASUS Vivobook laptops
 Qt 6 window with live CPU and GPU fan speed, temperatures, five-minute history
 graphs, a tray mode and controls for the background policy service.
 .
 The command line, root helper and services come from
 vivobook-fan-control-cli, which this package depends on.
